<h3><u>Akbar ne di sada</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Akbar (A.s.) Ne Di Sada, Seene Main Hai Naiza, Ghode Se Gir Raha Hun Baba Sambhal Na&hellip;&hellip;2<br />
Zakhmi Hai Kaleja, Hai Wakt Madad Ka, Ghode Se Gir Raha Hun Baba Sambhal Na&hellip;..</p>

<p>Akbar (A.s.) Ne Di Sada, Seene Main Hai Naiza, Ghode Se Gir Raha Hun Baba Sambhal Na&hellip;&hellip;2</p>

<p>1. Sukhi Hui Zaban Hai, Galba Hai Pyas Ka,<br />
Is Haal Mein Kahan Talab Karta Bhala Vigah<br />
Majboor Hun Baba, Ab Wakt Yeh Aaya,<br />
Ghode Se Gir Raha Hun Baba Sambhal Na&hellip;.<br />
Akbar (A.s.) Ne Di Sada, Seene Main Hai Naiza, Ghode Se Gir Raha Hun Baba Sambhal Na&hellip;&hellip;2</p>

<p>2. Baba Yeh Zakhm Aap Se Dekha Na Jaienga,<br />
Naiza Nikalte Hue Moh Apna Pherna,<br />
Hai Dard Gazab Ka, Dam Hoton Pe Aaya,<br />
Ghode Se Gir Raha Hun Baba Sambhal Na&hellip;.<br />
Akbar (A.s.) Ne Di Sada Seene Main Hai Naiza, Ghode Se Gir Raha Hun Baba Sambhal Na&hellip;&hellip;2</p>

<p>3. Haan Yeh Khabar Khayam Me Dena Na Baba Jaan,<br />
Mar Jaiengi Phupi Meri, Mar Jaiengi Woh Maan,<br />
Hai Wakt Qaza Ka, Aajao Khudara,<br />
Ghode Se Gir Raha Hun Baba Sambhal Na&hellip;..<br />
Akbar (A.s.) Ne Di Sada Seene Main Hai Naiza, Ghode Se Gir Raha Hun Baba Sambhal Na&hellip;&hellip;2</p>

<p>4. Kya Sakth Imtehan Hai Maloom Hai Mujhe,<br />
Tanah Pisar Ke Lash Ko Kaise Uthaienge,<br />
De Aap Ko Khuda, Yeh Sabr Hausla,<br />
Ghode Se Gir Raha Hun Baba Sambhal Na<br />
Akbar (A.s.) Ne Di Sada Seene Main Hai Naiza, Ghode Se Gir Raha Hun Baba Sambhal Na&hellip;&hellip;2</p>

<p>5. Mujh Se Siva Hai Aap Ki Lachargi Padar,<br />
Tanha Gai Hai Aap Hi Har Ek Lash Par,<br />
Hote Agar Chacha, To Mai Nahi Kehta,<br />
Ghode Se Gir Raha Hun Baba Sambhal Na<br />
Akbar (A.s.) Ne Di Sada Seene Main Hai Naiza, Ghode Se Gir Raha Hun Baba Sambhal Na&hellip;&hellip;2</p>

<p>6. Pohuchi Agar Sada Meri, Sughra (S.a.)Ke Kaan Tak,<br />
Hai Roiengi Is Tarha Bahan Gir Jaienga Falak,<br />
Woh Jee Sakengi Kya, Sun Kar Meri Sada,<br />
Ghode Se Gir Raha Hun Baba Sambhal Na<br />
Akbar (A.S.) Ne Di Sada Seene Main Hai Naiza, Ghode Se Gir Raha Hun Baba Sambhal Na&hellip;&hellip;2</p>

<p>7. Hota Hun Aap Se Juda Majboor Tishnakam,<br />
Baba Kubool Kijiye Yeh Aakhri Salam,<br />
Ya Shah E Do Sara (A.s.),<br />
Ab Hai Safar Mera, Ghode Se Gir Raha Hun Baba Sambhal Na<br />
Akbar (A.s.) Ne Di Sada Seene Main Hai Naiza, Ghode Se Gir Raha Hun Baba Sambhal Na&hellip;&hellip;2</p>

<p>8. Farhan Mazhar Abedi Kaisi Hai Bekasi,<br />
Budha Padar Uthaienga Maiyat Jawan Ki,<br />
Pohuche Shahe Huda (A.s.),<br />
Sun Kar Yeh Marsiya, Ghode Se Gir Raha Hun Baba Sambhal Na<br />
Akbar (A.sS.) Ne Di Sada Seene Main Hai Naiza, Ghode Se Gir Raha Hun Baba Sambhal Na&hellip;&hellip;2</p>
</p>
